    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">Given a <const>6</const>-character hexadecimal color string <var>hexCode</var>, calculate its perceived luminance.<br><br>Convert the color into its Red, Green, and Blue decimal components, each between <const>0</const> and <const>255</const>:<br>- <var>R</var>: characters <const>1</const> and <const>2</const><br>- <var>G</var>: characters <const>3</const> and <const>4</const><br>- <var>B</var>: characters <const>5</const> and <const>6</const><br><br>Calculate perceived luminance <var>L</var> using the standard formula:<br><var>L</var> = <const>0.299</const> * <var>R</var> + <const>0.587</const> * <var>G</var> + <const>0.114</const> * <var>B</var><br><br>Print the value of <var>L</var> rounded to the nearest integer.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1</strong>: A string <var>hexCode</var> containing <const>6</const> hexadecimal characters.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>A single line</strong>: An integer representing the perceived luminance <var>L</var> rounded to the nearest integer.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\"><var>hexCode</var> has length <const>6</const>.<br>Characters are uppercase <const>0</const>-<const>9</const> and <const>A</const>-<const>F</const>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">FFFFFF</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">255</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
